WEBVTT

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.590
Red...

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:12.740
Kill this guy.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:20.050
Didn't you hear me?

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:23.040
Kill this guy!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.880
I'm a detective and I'm a robber!

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:04.830
Big brother...

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:09.070
He didn't know that this area was Black Dragon's island.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:15.400
That's why...

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.510
Hakkai is...

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:19.170
He's as scared as someone else.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:22.600
I didn't ask you that.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.750
Can't you hear my order?

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:29.340
You're my brother before you're a robber.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:30.000
In other words, my order is...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.250
I'm sure of it.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:36.400
The bond of a family is above that of a friend, right?

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:43.180
Taiju! Don't push Hakkai too far!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:50.670
Yuzuha, it's your own problem.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:54.310
I'll teach you a lot later.

00:02:54.310 --> 00:03:00.000
Brother!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.860
Yuzuha is a woman!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:05.500
Are you going to hit your sister?

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:08.450
Don't talk about the Shiba family problem.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.450
Bastard!

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:13.890
Akkai, take a look.

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:16.940
I'll take care of it for you.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.090
This is the bond!

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.440
Take this!

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.560
Stop it already!

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.280
Oshina!

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.740
But I can't just stand and watch!

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:42.080
Takemichi-kun is going to die!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:42.730
Ina...

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.150
Do it...

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:46.940
Oshina!

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:48.530
Takemichi-kun...

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:49.500
Takemichi-kun!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.250
B-brother!

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.540
Huh?

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.060
Please stop!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:55.170
Please!

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.370
Aka...

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:00.000
When you ask someone for something...

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:03.920
You need to exchange conditions, don't you?

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:08.440
Give me something that suits you.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:10.150
Otherwise,

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:12.260
I'm going to be in trouble here.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:15.430
I'm going to quit.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.290
I'm going to quit.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:19.840
I'm going to quit.

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:24.410
I'm going to join the Black Dragon to support my brother.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.520
So let Takemichi go.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.190
Exchange conditions!

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:28.930
Hmph.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.200
Are you okay, Takamichi?

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.380
I'm going to the hospital from now on.

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:10.280
Oh, I see.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.710
I'm angry.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:15.060
I'm going to quit Touman.

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:18.270
So let go of Takemichi.

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:20.150
I'm sorry, Hakkai.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:21.990
Touman because of me.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:24.150
It's not your fault.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:26.040
I've been making up my mind.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:30.000
More importantly, thank you for protecting Yuzuha.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.350
The leader of the Black Dragons is my brother, right?

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.590
Yes.

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:40.830
The 11th Black Dragon leader, Shiba Hakkai.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:47.880
Rumor has it that he killed his brother-in-law for money and took the Black Dragon.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:51.280
Killing his brother-in-law? That means this guy...

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:55.660
I have something to do with the Black Dragons.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:06:00.000
No way! Hakkai killed his brother-in-law?

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:08.660
That's what you're saying!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:11.860
I'm going to the island of Black Dragon!

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.800
It doesn't matter if it's a woman or not.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:16.520
I'll kill them all.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.450
No...

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:26.240
I've come to understand one thing at a time.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:29.600
If what Kazutora-kun will say in the future is true...

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:34.860
Shiba Hakkai killed his predecessors and took over Black Dragon.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:38.450
There's something I want to do in Black Dragon.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:44.340
Hakkai will kill the leader of Black Dragon, his real brother, Taiji.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:49.450
And if Hakkai takes over Black Dragon and joins the sect,

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.700
it will lead to that future!

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:57.650
Should I stop Hakkai from killing my brother?

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:00.000
Something's not right.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:03.620
I don't care if Hakkai is the best or if Taiji is the best.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:06.890
I don't think Black Dragon's weakness will change.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.280
Then I'll have to fight Black Dragon?

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:12.520
I can't do this.

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:13.860
I definitely can't.

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:19.200
Black Dragon's number will increase first.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:22.280
But I have to solve it.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:29.000
I have no choice but to do it myself.

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:35.800
What are you talking about, Kinomichi?

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.970
Why did you come to my house?

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:41.180
It's a visit, isn't it?

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:45.170
You're the captain, so be aware.

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:49.370
If you overdo it, we won't be able to support the first team.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:52.380
The first team?

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.520
Did you join Touman?

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.520
Yes, we did.

00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:59.700
You put them in, didn't you?

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:03.510
Shifuyu...

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:06.200
What's with this circle?

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:10.180
No, it's nothing.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:13.760
But the one who broke the balance is Black Dragon, huh?

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:16.990
Yeah... It's going to be rough from now on.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:19.860
The people above us aren't quiet, are they?

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:24.060
If you're angry at Takemichi, it'll be enough as a sacrifice.

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.140
What?

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:26.940
It's not what you think.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:30.000
Right now, you're the only leader of Touman.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.860
Now that you've teamed up with the Black Dragons,

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.490
I don't think you'll be able to get away with it.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.010
As long as I hear the rumors,

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.780
I can't compete with anyone else.

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:42.840
Are you saying that Mebius is stronger than Valhalla?

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.330
It's a murder squad.

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:48.980
That's their selling point.

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:51.320
They're really good at fighting.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:53.820
For a long time, the Black Dragons

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:58.140
have been a team that has been at the top of Kanto's bad guys.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.000
Among them, the 10th generation

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.140
The Black Dragons are the strongest and the worst in history.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:05.810
Oh, the strongest is the crazy one.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.370
Isn't that too much?

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:09.880
There's one reason for that.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:14.150
The absolute warrior, Shiba Taiju.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:18.340
Originally, Touman and the Black Dragons had a deep connection.

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:24.060
Because the reason for the formation of Touman was the Black Dragons.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:27.200
The legendary Touman's first battle.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:30.000
Kazutora, who lived on their island at the time,

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.740
The Black Dragon and Kazutora were having a fight.

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:37.710
To save Kazutora, his friends came together and formed a team.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:40.320
That's the Tokyo Manjikai.

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:43.190
The Black Dragon was hit from the front,

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:47.340
and Touman, who crushed him, became a famous member of the team.

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:48.990
That's amazing, Touman.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:52.390
Does that mean we have no choice but to fight each other again?

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:54.460
But, if you're going to crush me this time,

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.130
wouldn't it be easy this time as well?

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:58.220
It's not easy.

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:00.000
When Touman crushed him,

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.930
Shiba Taiju was the 9th generation of Black Dragon.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:05.810
Menz is completely different from now.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:11.770
Shiba Taiju revived the Black Dragon that was supposed to disappear after being destroyed by To-Man.

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:19.000
I accept the name of the team, but Taiju changed the Black Dragon to something else than before.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:25.030
He transformed into Toppuku, raised the members like an army, and made them something to admire from the looks of it.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:27.150
He's amazing...

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:30.000
But in the first place, he's the toppuku of Zenibun.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.820
It would cost a lot of money to get all of them at once.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:33.860
That's true.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:36.090
How did you get that much money?

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:38.090
You're about the same age as us, aren't you?

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:40.220
Yeah, I'm two years older.

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:47.860
What's different about Taiji from other bad guys is that he sells violence.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:50.320
Taiji isn't just a warrior.

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:54.270
He's connected to the rich and gets money instead of giving it to the army.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.440
In other words, it's a business?

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:59.760
Does that mean he's fighting for money?

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.280
What kind of kid is this?

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:04.110
He's from a different world.

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:08.960
For the sake of money, I'll connect to the Black Dragon of the future.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:11.720
So I'm the Black Dragon after all!

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:16.220
Anyway, the current Black Dragon is different from the 9th generation.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:18.250
If you argue with Touman right now...

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:21.280
Ugh... I'm sorry, but...

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.620
There's no need to argue.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.430
Huh?

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:27.970
This is a problem between me and the Black Dragon.

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:30.000
Touman has nothing to do with this.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:32.940
I'll take care of it on my own.

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:35.790
Takemichi, you!

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.210
What are you talking about?

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.790
On my own...

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:41.920
Sorry.

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:46.640
Takemichi, come with me for a bit.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:47.480
Huh?

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:09.630
It's a good bike, isn't it?

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:12.880
It's Baji-san's favorite.

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:14.520
Chifuyu...

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.460
I know.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.450
You're telling me not to carry it on my own.

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:20.630
But...

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:23.850
The future I've seen is too dangerous!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:26.700
I know you want to say you have friends.

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:27.670
But...

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:29.350
Akkun and you...

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:30.000
You're going to die!

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:33.590
What about me!?

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:37.270
Haha, I didn't come here to say that.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.890
Huh?

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:41.810
But you know, let's have fun.

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:46.170
Fuyu...

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:52.340
Baji-san, I didn't entrust Touman to catch you.

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:54.350
You're angry, Baji-san.

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:57.200
Why are you looking down on me, you piece of sh*t?

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.450
...

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.120
I'm not alone!

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:03.920
Chifuyu!

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.130
I...

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:06.530
I...

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:11.400
I came from the future!

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:15.700
What are you saying?

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.060
You came from the future?

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.840
Umm...

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:23.670
That...

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:24.690
Manne...

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:27.830
It's overflowing more and more...

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:29.320
The day I died...

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.000
In the past...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:35.060
In order to save Hina who died, I went into a coma.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:38.640
I can only go back to the day 12 years ago.

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:40.090
About Mikey-kun.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.230
About Draken-kun.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:43.500
Shisaki.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:46.880
The future of winter.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:52.730
I won't tell anyone about Time Leap.

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.480
That's what I swore.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:58.750
Because I don't know what kind of influence it will have on the present.

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.000
But this guy...

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:03.270
If Shifuyu, who died for me even in the modern era, is still alive...

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:06.850
I've lost my mind.

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:12.530
This is all I've done.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:19.290
I'm going to be killed by Kisaki.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.330
It's gone.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.760
I've lost everything.

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:26.550
This is bad, isn't it?

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.880
What should I do?

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.920
I...

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:32.600
You're going to die.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.980
What are you talking about?

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.560
It's a joke, it's a joke.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.340
Hahaha.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:42.460
Somehow I realized.

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:48.190
No, I didn't think you'd come from the future.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:51.850
Come to think of it, you have a lot of strange things.

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:54.470
There were times when the atmosphere was different than usual.

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:55.570
That's...

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:57.040
Um...

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:00.000
Before the final battle with Valhalla, you were...

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.000
I asked Baji-san.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.430
Please.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:03.640
Don't die.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:08.340
We were apart, so I don't know what he was talking about.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:11.190
But he did say that.

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:14.910
You knew that Baji-san was going to die, didn't you?

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:17.470
That's why you were so desperate.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.450
Yeah.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:22.170
I knew it, but I couldn't stop it.

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:24.570
I saved Baji-kun.

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:27.120
You're amazing.

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:30.000
You fought alone.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:30.900
You knew it, didn't you?

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.160
Even though no one praised me...

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.110
Take it easy, Takemichi.

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:39.100
The important thing is not the result.

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:43.590
Even though no one looked at me, I fought without running away.

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:45.770
I respect you.

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:47.980
You believe me?

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:49.410
This...

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:51.330
This kind of lie...

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.810
Of course, you idiot.

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:56.370
We're partners, right?

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:59.250
I'm glad I talked to him after all!

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:02.590
Don't make me cry!

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:05.470
Your tears are all over the place.

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:08.470
I can't help it! I'm going to make you cry!

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:09.470
I'm hungry.

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:13.690
Listen to me!

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:17.250
GanShi, are you going to let Kisaki kill you?

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.390
Go.

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:22.160
I don't care about Mirai!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.770
Kisaki is still Baji-san's enemy.

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:27.050
Yeah, that's for sure.

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:30.000
I heard it clearly from Mirai's Kisaki.

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.660
I'm going to kill you.

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:33.270
But not now.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:37.440
There are 100 members of the third unit led by Kisaki.

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:42.080
There is also the sixth unit that was newly established by the former Valhalla.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:45.390
On the other hand, you and I are the first unit.

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:48.280
It's still fresh and doesn't work well.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:50.070
It's the difference in fate.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:52.960
Yeah, I'm excited.

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:53.970
What?

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:58.740
You're going to make the first unit that won't lose to anyone from now on.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.000
Takemichi.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:04.590
It's a start from scratch, but you can do it.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:08.000
Whether it's Black Dragon or Kisaki, I'll crush them.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.290
I'll support you to the end.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:15.400
That's my answer to you who told me everything.

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.840
Shifuyu...

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:20.770
I'll be in your care from now on.

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:24.280
All right! I'll do it!

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:27.440
Thank you, Shifuyu!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.830
Buddy!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.730
Kimi-chan, did you eat all of my ramen?

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:33.310
What?

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:34.340
No, you gave it to me.

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.900
Idiot! If you eat a bite, you usually give it back, right?

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:40.720
No, I usually think I don't need it anymore if I give it to you.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:48.290
I didn't know that Hakkai was the brother of the director of Black Dragon.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.420
You knew, didn't you, Mitsuya?

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:55.320
Black Dragon is a pain in the ass.

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:57.280
I have no choice but to do it.

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.760
Did all the executives gather?

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:04.650
Get in!

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:09.880
As you all know,

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:13.940
Takemichi was hit in the head by the Black Dragon the other day.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:18.290
Takemichi is known to be the leader of the Black Dragon.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:22.820
In other words, this is a declaration of war against the Black Dragon.

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:27.690
Don't underestimate us! Let's do this!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.730
We're a team that's been crushed once.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.300
It's easy for you, isn't it?

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:33.680
The 9th generation is the one who destroyed it.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.980
The current 10th generation is something else.

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.390
Actually,

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:41.700
Takemichi doesn't know about the Black Dragon Island, so it can't be helped.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:45.000
Why are you taking Takemichi there?

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:48.220
I've never seen you guys talking in the first place.

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:49.230
What?

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:50.430
Akkai.

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:54.800
Aren't you the one who took care of the Black Dragon, you bastard?

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.960
He's the chief's brother.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:19:00.000
You hid it.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:01.410
Please wait a moment!

00:19:01.690 --> 00:19:02.810
That's not what Hakkai intends to do!

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:04.430
Shut up, you bastard!

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:08.260
Listen, Takemichi.

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:12.220
At the next meeting, Hakkai will probably quit Touman.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:15.020
And it will lead to your future.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:19.890
To change the future, we must prevent Hakkai from leaving Touman.

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:23.300
I've made a plan with Chifuyu for this.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.360
I have no intention of making excuses.

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:30.000
I don't care whether you like it or not.

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:34.710
I'm prepared for that at the point where I'm his brother.

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:36.730
So, Chief!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.810
Vice-Captain of the Second Division!

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:40.330
Shiba Hakkai!

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:41.790
On this day!

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:44.020
I will stop the Tokyo Manjikai!

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:49.720
Is that okay?

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:58.240
Yes, it is!

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.790
Akemi...

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:04.990
But how can we prevent Hakkai from escaping?

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:07.220
I have a plan.

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.410
First, Plan A.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:12.740
Yu-yu!

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:14.680
The core is Mikey-kun.

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:18.200
If Mikey-kun doesn't accept Hakkai escaping,

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:20.000
things will work out.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.310
I see.

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:25.490
And I know Mikey-kun's weakness.

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:26.630
Mikey-kun!

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:27.320
Hm?

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:30.000
Let's calm down and think about it.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.000
I'll eat it!

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:32.050
Plan A!

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:32.970
That's...

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:34.020
Dorayaki!

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:35.330
Here you go!

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.330
I don't need it.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:39.730
You're in my way.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:40.730
What?

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:43.070
Are you kidding me?

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:45.490
Not at all!

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:50.010
Don't worry, Takemichi.

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:53.880
Even if you fail, there's a Plan B.

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:57.080
If you're in trouble, look at this memo.

00:20:57.080 --> 00:21:00.000
Chifuyu wrote a memo for a time like this!

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:02.060
B!

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.350
Yeah!

00:21:03.350 --> 00:21:05.940
Chifuyu Sotaro!

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:09.220
I forgot.

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:11.590
He was an idiot.

00:21:11.590 --> 00:21:14.990
I can't stop Hakkai like this.

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:18.040
I'm going to be in trouble if I keep this up.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.700
What should I do?

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:22.210
What are you going to do, Maiki?

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:24.300
The second unit.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.400
You decide.

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:39.110
Taka-chan, I'm sorry. I've already made up my mind.

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:47.770
Don't look like that, Hakkai. I know what you're thinking.

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:55.450
Taka-chan, thank you for your help!

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:59.510
What should I do? I can't change anything, can I?

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:08.010
What the hell are you talking about? I don't admit it.

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:11.460
What?

00:22:11.460 --> 00:22:16.390
I want to protect the things I love, I want to protect them, it's painful.
